# MoniGarr fork-only: PRD 2 & PRD2 Modernized documentation (internal; omit from public GitHub/GitLab)
# Note: if these paths were already committed, run: git rm -r --cached -- <paths> && git commit
**/*PRD2_MODERNIZED*.md
**/PRD2_MODERNIZE.md
**/PATIENT_DASHBOARD_MIGRATION.md
**/AUDIT_PRD2.md
**/USERS_PRD2.md
**/ARCHITECTURE_PRD2.md
**/ARCHITECTURE_RISKS_PRD2.md
**/USERS_ARCHITECTURE_RISKS_PRD2.md
**/AGENT_TEAM_PRD2*.md
**/PRD_2_*.md
**/PRD_2*.pdf
**/PRD_Week*.pdf

# Track PRD2 Modernized documentation canon under Documentation/ (exceptions to rules above)
!Documentation/
!Documentation/**/*.md

